        "type": "text",
        "text": "Lichens are found growing on trees, walls, rocks and soil.",
        "source": {
          "qp": 20
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Fig. 9.1 shows a lichen of the genus <i>Usnea. Usnea</i> can tolerate only low concentrations of sulfur dioxide and does not grow in places where the air is polluted with sulfur dioxide.",
        "source": {
          "qp": 20
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "figure",
        "id": "fig9.1",
        "caption": "<b>Fig. 9.1</b>",
